      <activity id="05693e63-edfa-5d4a-b8bd-15801e759d03" activityNameId="a65ae877-1aef-51ee-bbaa-a2fa4a8b6c5a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road
Multi-output process providing the products "round wood, primary forest, clear-cutting, at forest road" and "provision, stubbed land". Emissions from wood burning and land transformation are allocated to the provision of stubbed land.;
UUID: 171b4581-8e36-3c55-884f-6e8d85e95bd9
Resources (wood, carbon, land), land transformation, emissions from wood burning, rough estimation for machinery use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Clear-cutting of primary forests with burning of biomass.
Time period: Publication of data
Production volume: about 2 Mio. ha/a for soy beans
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Rough estimation of machinery use with European forestry data. Emissions profile for tropical forest per kg of dry biomass.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_171b4581-8e36-3c55-884f-6e8d85e95bd9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
